Z||000002||GarethWright||09-11-2001||05:15 PM||||News said the gas prices that high and the shortage were a hoax, but the cops were called on several people beating each up at the gas stations.  I drove past a gas station just past noon and there were 5-6 cars lined up at each pump, and this was a 12 pump station.<BR>Plus, we had schools closed and kids sent home early, but T.C.C (where I go) didn't close until After my classes this morning, so I still had to go.<BR>but if thats the worst that happens around here, I'll be happy.||||reg||1
Z||000003||rogergarrison||09-11-2001||05:17 PM||||its not a hoax. just went up .40 per gallon across the street.||||reg||1
