Z||000008||mrfiero||09-11-2001||05:49 PM||||I had heard similar stories and went ahead and filled up my 2 Fieros (to the brim!) and a few portable gas containers too (just in case).<P>Gas here in Denver has not gone up but there are rumors that many locations across the country (such as you guys in OK) are being gouged at $4-$5/gallon.<P>If we do "glass" the midlle east (i.e. go to war) you can expect gas prices to be high and quantities scarce for some time to come.  Let's hope it does not come to that, but I have a sneaky suspicion that it will.||||reg||1
