Z||000027||Wannabe||09-12-2001||02:20 PM||||Sounds like the Chicken Little syndrome - "The Sky Is Falling" Every time people hear a plane coming they think it's going to crash into a building. If this act starts to create hysteria of any kind, then the terrorist are winning. This was an act perpetrated by a very small and very weak group of people who were able to sneak around, take advantage of the trust that exist in a free society, and get through security. Things may be a bit shakey for a while as the damage and loss is being assesed, and new steps are taken to guard against these crazies, but man, let's stay calm. Keep your savings in the bank, and don't start armng yourself to blow away  neighbors that you alway got along with - that's what the terrorists want. They can't bring down the world. "Don't get mad, get even!"||||reg||1
